    "content": "Bitcoin achieved its best-performing third quarter since 2017, finishing the July-to-September period with strong gains. The cryptocurrency carried this positive momentum into early October by clearing a heavy sell wall near the $85,000 price level. Boosted by soft employment data from the United States, BTC prices rebounded strongly, trading back toward their highest levels of the year amid growing market optimism.",
